/dist

# Local agent working directories. These hold a maintainer's own plans,
# measurement transcripts, and reference clones of the projects this design
# draws on. They are private working material, never distributed source, and
# nothing under `crates/` or `docs/` may depend on a path inside them.
.omo/
.zuno/

*.pdb
.DS_Store

# CodeGraph's local index: a derived artifact of this checkout, like /target.
# Rebuilt by `codegraph init`; never a source of truth.
/.codegraph

# Scratch directories reviewers and subagents create while probing this checkout
# (LSP sandboxes, worktree-scoped temp dirs). Derived, never source.
/.tmp-*
